{
  "answer": "The Production Database Access SOP describes the operational steps for how an engineer requests, receives, and loses production database access [da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13]. It applies to every engineer needing direct read or write access to a production database, such as on-call engineers, those debugging customer issues, or running one-time data migrations [da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13]. Engineers request access via the internal tools portal form, which requires sign-off from the data owner and two engineering managers (one from a different team) [da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13]. Approved access is granted for three days and expires automatically [da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13]. Engineers must have completed annual security training within the last ninety days [da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13]. During an incident, on-call engineers can request break-glass emergency access without standard approval [da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13]. All access grants are logged and reviewed weekly by Security Engineering [da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13], and access can be revoked early by either approver or the data owner [91d4f121536a0880dff84e83193cd833]. Service accounts and automated jobs follow a separate process requiring data owner and two manager sign-offs, with standing access reviewed quarterly [91d4f121536a0880dff84e83193cd833].",
  "citations": [
    "da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13",
    "91d4f121536a0880dff84e83193cd833"
  ],
  "sufficient_evidence": true
}

{
  "answer": "During an active incident, an on-call engineer may request break-glass access to production systems without waiting for the standard approval review [e3e91b1f9845f9e5b17e8e375d325dd9, da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13, f9cbee4e0939d52e95eebe93a063a85c]. Unlike a normal request—which requires sign-off from the data owner and two engineering managers [da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13]—break-glass access does not require the standard approval flow, is granted immediately, and is automatically logged for review by a security engineer on the next business day [e3e91b1f9845f9e5b17e8e375d325dd9, da1cdb5e0e87ad69728e9d2781239d13, f9cbee4e0939d52e95eebe93a063a85c].",
